sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Operator
  participant UI as POS UI
  participant UseCase as Sale Use Case
  participant Repo as Transaction Repository
  participant Orchestrator as Payment Orchestrator
  participant Processor as Mock Processor
  participant Hardware as Terminal Simulator
  Operator->>UI: Enter synthetic amount and submit
  UI->>UseCase: Execute sale(request, idempotencyKey)
  UseCase->>Repo: Find existing operation by idempotency key
  alt Existing logical operation
    Repo-->>UseCase: Existing transaction
    UseCase-->>UI: Return existing result (no duplicate charge)
  else New logical operation
    UseCase->>Repo: Persist CREATED transaction
    UseCase->>Orchestrator: Process transaction
    Orchestrator->>Hardware: Check terminal capability/status
    Hardware-->>Orchestrator: Ready / unavailable
    alt Terminal ready
      Orchestrator->>Repo: Persist PROCESSING
      Orchestrator->>Processor: Authorize synthetic request + idempotency key
      alt Approved or declined response
        Processor-->>Orchestrator: Definitive simulated outcome
        Orchestrator->>Repo: Persist APPROVED or DECLINED
        Orchestrator-->>UseCase: Safe transaction result
      else Timeout or connection lost
        Processor--xOrchestrator: Outcome cannot be confirmed
        Orchestrator->>Repo: Persist UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
        Orchestrator->>Repo: Mark reconciliation required
        Orchestrator-->>UseCase: Pending confirmation; do not create a new charge
      end
    else Terminal unavailable
      Orchestrator->>Repo: Persist safe failure / retryable pre-processing status
      Orchestrator-->>UseCase: Terminal unavailable
    end
    UseCase-->>UI: Display result and safe reference
  end
